-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">I would be grateful for any help on\nthis!</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 0pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Regards,</span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\n\n</font><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Masha</span></p></div><font face=\"CMR10\" size=\"3\"><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><br></p><font face=\"CMR10\" size=\"3\"><p style=\"background:white;margin:0cm 0cm 3pt;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><br></p><div><br></div></font></font></div>"
